      "message": "Let\u0027s create two generic GPIO name: GPIO_PMIC_EN and GPIO_V5A_EN.\n\nFor board design with two GPIO, then create these GPIO in gpio.inc.\n\nFor board design with single GPIO, then create one GPIO in gpio.inc and use #define to make the other GPIO points to the same one in board.h.",
