      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checked the PMIC spec, PMIC_EN(V5A_EN) should be turned on after external 5V/3.3V VR is enabled, which is EN_PP5500.\n\nWith the above GPIO name change suggestion, we should:\nFirst enable GPIO_V5A_EN (Reef current GPIO_EN_PP5000)\nThen enable GPIO_PMIC_EN (Reef current GPIO_V5A_EN) \n\nV3P3A (EN_PP3300) is turned on in Reef board_init and not turn off else where, so that should be ok.",
